    "detailed_description": "<h1>Dice Battle</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/b2bf577b01ed2fbe30f4cd8d554b4bb5.avif?t=1754314282\" width=600 height=190 /></span></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Battle brings the thrill of friendly competition as you roll the dice, strategize your moves, and enjoy moments of triumph and tension. It's a fun, lighthearted experience that keeps you engaged and eager for the next turn.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/598b9f7bba9e5d822f8b077f9568f517.poster.avif?t=1754314282\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/598b9f7bba9e5d822f8b077f9568f517.webm?t=1754314282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/598b9f7bba9e5d822f8b077f9568f517.mp4?t=1754314282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Dice Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice Battle offers a fun and competitive experience where every roll of the dice brings excitement and suspense. Combining strategy and chance, the game keeps you engaged as you plan your moves and race to victory. Designed as a modern take on the classic Ludo board game, it provides an easy-to-learn yet deeply rewarding gameplay experience that\u2019s perfect for both casual players and board game enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/a97968ad1ca8b87356719b6396c54b59.poster.avif?t=1754314282\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/a97968ad1ca8b87356719b6396c54b59.webm?t=1754314282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/a97968ad1ca8b87356719b6396c54b59.mp4?t=1754314282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring a vibrant, colorful design and intuitive controls, Dice Battle supports both single-player and multiplayer modes, allowing you to play against AI opponents or challenge friends. The game follows traditional Ludo-style mechanics, where players move their pieces around the board based on dice rolls, aiming to reach the goal before their opponents. Tactical choices, lucky rolls, and unpredictable twists make every match unique. Whether you're looking for a quick game or an intense battle, Dice Battle offers endless fun for players of all ages.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice Battle brings the thrill of friendly competition as you roll the dice, strategize your moves, and enjoy moments of triumph and tension. It's a fun, lighthearted experience that keeps you engaged and eager for the next turn.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/598b9f7bba9e5d822f8b077f9568f517.poster.avif?t=1754314282\" width=600 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/598b9f7bba9e5d822f8b077f9568f517.webm?t=1754314282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/598b9f7bba9e5d822f8b077f9568f517.mp4?t=1754314282\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About Dice Battle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dice Battle offers a fun and competitive experience where every roll of the dice brings excitement and suspense. Combining strategy and chance, the game keeps you engaged as you plan your moves and race to victory. Designed as a modern take on the classic Ludo board game, it provides an easy-to-learn yet deeply rewarding gameplay experience that\u2019s perfect for both casual players and board game enthusiasts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/a97968ad1ca8b87356719b6396c54b59.poster.avif?t=1754314282\" width=600 height=330 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3587010/extras/a97968ad1ca8b87356719b6396c54b59.webm?t=1754314282\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.